  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Sprinkle over Aussie spice blend, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Remove pan from heat and add the honey, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369dfd42dc4b928197e495/step-32ac7d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop celery.\n• Slice tomato into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369dfd42dc4b928197e495/step-03cd4810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve bake-at-home ciabatta and toast to your liking.\n• Meanwhile, place garlic paste (see ingredients) and the butter in a large microwave-safe bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until melted and fragrant.\n• Cut or tear toasted ciabatta into bite-sized chunks and add to bowl with garlic butter, tossing to coat. Season with a pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369dfd42dc4b928197e495/step-3fdf4220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine celery, tomato, mixed salad leaves, mustard-cider dressing, toasted garlic ciabatta and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Slice chick'n if preferred.\n• Divide crouton salad between bowls. Top with spiced chicken. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369dfd42dc4b928197e495/step-073a1230.jpg"
    }
  ]
